 36S 2c  resonances.                                                            
 36S  c  1985Gy02, 1985GyZZ: {+36}S(|p-,|p-) E=48.4 MeV, measured |s(|q).       
 36S  c  1971Ar32: {+232}Th({+40}Ar,X) at E=290 MeV, measured yields.           
 36S  c  {+36}S radius measurements:                                            
 36S  c  1985Sc05: measured muonic x-ray energies, deduced rms charge radii.    
