 36S  c  2018Va09: shell model (sdpfu-mix), levels, J, |p; mirror energy        
 36S 2c  differences in {+36}Ca-{+36}S.                                         
 36S  c  2017Bo18: shell model (PSDPF), levels, J, |p, B(E2), and B(E3).        
