 36S 4cG R{-DCO}(Q)|?0.55 for stretched dipole (|DJ=1) transitions. Expected    
 36S 5cG R{-DCO} values in a stretched dipole gate are R{-DCO}(D)|?1.1 for      
 36S 6cG stretched dipole (|DJ=1) transitions; R{-DCO}(D)|?1.8 for stretched    
 36S 7cG quadrupole (|DJ=2) or unstretched dipole (|DJ=0) transitions. A        
 36S 8cG positive POL indicates an electric type transition, and a negative POL 
 36S 9cG indicates a magnetic type transition.                                  
